  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Krsnaa Diagnostics Network Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up to INR3,600 million ($42.4 million) from ADB&amp;apos;s Ordinary Capital Resources for senior, secured, non-convertible debentures (NCD) facility to KDL to (i) install and operate radiology diagnostics equipment and services (CT, MRI,) in 31 public hospitals in Maharashtra in PPP mode; (ii) develop and operate 180 pathology laboratories and 1,500 sample collection centers in government hospitals across Rajasthan in PPP mode; and (iii) towards capital cost for developing up to two cancer diagnostic centers.</narrative>
  </description>
